INTERPRETATION
  - V0 (1.2.3): URL session-id fixation reaches the flag (no guard).
  - V1 (1.2.4): first-request fixation BLOCKED by the :cookie_only guard; the CVE-2007-6077 residual
                (one warmup request first) BYPASSES the now-inert guard (mutation) -> reaches the flag.
  - V2 (1.2.6): residual blocked (guard re-derived fresh each request).

DATA QUALITY: distinct releases/commits (1.2.4 vs 1.2.6). CVE-2007-6077 is explicitly "an incomplete fix
  for CVE-2007-5380" (NVD). Same sink, shared guard lineage. Not co-disclosed / same-release / same-commit.

